    "Classify to outfit_slot separately from ecommerce hierarchy.",
    "Never infer a brand without visible logo, readable label/OCR, receipt metadata, or user confirmation.",
    "Store brand confidence and evidence separately.",
    "Material is an estimate unless a care/composition label is readable.",
    "Allow multiple occasions, vibes, seasons, colours and style tags.",
    "Prefer canonical Product Type values, but preserve original AI/vendor wording in raw_metadata.",
    "If a photo contains multiple garments, either split into individual items or store as Full Outfit with linked components."
